   $fh = tempfile( DIR => $dir );
 
+A prefix can be added to the auto-generated filename using PREFIX:
+
+  ($fh, $filename) = tempfile( PREFIX => 'myprog' );
+
+This generates a filename like C</tmp/myprogXXXXXXXXXX>.  Useful for
+hinting at which program created the file.  PREFIX is ignored when an
+explicit template is supplied.
+
